    "description": {
      "value": "Clockwork mechanisms tick away inside the weights of these bola, spooling out more cord in midair.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nThe cord of the bola snakes out as you throw it, allowing the weapon to wrap around a group of enemies. You use the bolas to attempt a ranged Trip against all creatures in a 5-foot radius burst within the weapon's first range increment. Roll a separate Athletics check for each target. Each attempt counts toward your multiple attack penalty, but don't increase your penalty until you have made all the attempts."
